            "review_1_highlight": "\"Perfect for sensitive teeth\"",
            "review_1_quote": "\"I ordered this toothpaste because my boyfriend and I have sensitive teeth. The tube came sealed and the shape of the cap made it easier to twist on/off. This toothpaste worked really well for us and didn't bother us at all! Our teeth didn't hurt after using this and it cleaned very well. \"",
            "review_1_author": "Jennie",
            "review_2_highlight": "\"Light mint, gentle on sensitivity, and consistent with Boka quality\"",
            "review_2_quote": "\"What I love most is the nano-hydroxyapatite formula for enamel support, plus being fluoride-free, sulfate-free, and free from artificial additives. It feels like I’m actually supporting my teeth long-term instead of just masking problems.\n\nIf you already like Boka or want a gentle sensitivity toothpaste with a soft mint flavor, this one is definitely worth trying.\"\"",
            "review_2_author": "Allie",
            "review_3_highlight": "\"Ride or Die Toothpaste (Yes, Really)\"",
            "review_3_quote": "\"First off: the sensitivity relief is real. I used to brace myself before sipping cold water or eating ice cream. After consistent twice-daily brushing, that sharp zing? Basically gone. The combo of potassium nitrate + nano hydroxyapatite has my teeth feeling protected instead of dramatic.\"",
