            "review_1_highlight": "\"Love this toothpaste\"",
            "review_1_quote": "\"After consistent use, my teeth feel protected, my gums are happy, and I don’t get that sharp zing anymore. It genuinely feels like a premium, science-backed toothpaste that delivers real results. If you struggle with sensitivity and want something gentle, effective, and thoughtfully formulated, this one is absolutely worth it.\"",
            "review_1_author": "Drowsy D.",
            "review_2_highlight": "\"Mild mint, works well\"",
            "review_2_quote": "\"I've purchased boka toothpaste before so I was excited to try this one when I saw it. The mint flavor is pleasant and very mild. This leaves my teeth feeling clean. I'm happy with this and will definitely use it all and hope to try the other flavor options in the future. A little pricey, but very high quality.\"",
            "review_2_author": "Yong",
            "review_3_highlight": "\"Good Sensitive Teeth Toothpaste\"",
            "review_3_quote": "\"This Boka toothpaste has helped with cold sensitivity in my teeth. It's not a cure, but after a week or so of daily use, I'm noticing I'm able to tolerate very cold food like ice cream and chilled water without wincing as much. The taste is fine, it's not overpowering, and texture wise doesn't feel any different then other toothpaste I've used.\"",
