    "custom_collapsible_content_p9cV6M": {
      "type": "custom-collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_giWPe8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does Boka toothpaste for sensitive teeth work?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our toothpaste for sensitive teeth uses 5% potassium nitrate, a science-backed ingredient that reduces and prevents sensitivity by soothing the nerves. With twice-daily brushing for two minutes, it builds protection against common triggers like cold, heat, acids, and sweets.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3brPNJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " What makes Boka Sensitive Toothpaste different from other sensitivity toothpastes?",
            "row_content": "<p>Unlike many traditional options, Boka offers a fluoride-free sensitivity toothpaste powered by a combination of potassium nitrate and nano-hydroxyapatite (n-Ha). Originally developed for astronauts in the 1970s, n-Ha is a revolutionary material that mimics tooth enamel. </p><p>While potassium nitrate makes our paste appropriate for sensitive teeth, the addition of n-Ha means you’re brushing with a science-backed ingredient that naturally makes up 97% of your enamel. It’s a biocompatible, thoughtfully formulated solution that is free from SLS, parabens, and artificial colors.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xnRnWY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this toothpaste provide 24/7 sensitivity protection?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. With twice-daily brushing and when used as directed, Boka Sensitive Toothpaste helps provide 24/7 protection against tooth sensitivity by building protection against cold drinks, ice cream, hot soup, acidic beverages, and other triggers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9VYexg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does \"Mint Cream\" taste like?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Mint Cream flavor is a mild and refreshing blend of Mint, Coconut, and Cream. It’s a silky-smooth flavor designed to make your daily brush more pleasant, providing a delicious taste without the use of artificial colors, sodium saccharin, or sucralose.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zy7XFj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " Is Boka sensitive toothpaste safe for children?",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka Sensitive toothpaste is recommended for adults and children 12 years of age and older. For children under 12 years of age, we recommend consulting a dentist or doctor before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_APpybE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use Boka Sensitivity Toothpaste for best results?",
            "row_content": "<p>Apply at least a 1-inch strip of toothpaste onto a soft-bristle toothbrush. Brush thoroughly for two minutes, twice daily, making sure to focus on all sensitive areas of the teeth. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PbXL77": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this toothpaste help with bad breath?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Along with providing sensitivity relief, our formula contains Xylitol and botanical extracts that refresh your mouth with a mild, clean flavor. It effectively freshens breath while you brush, leaving your mouth feeling invigorated.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UUDFxQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use Boka Sensitive Toothpaste every day?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Boka Sensitive Toothpaste is safe for daily use and non-toxic when used as directed. This way, you maintain sensitivity relief and keep your mouth feeling fresh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DajVkF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Boka Sensitive Toothpaste vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "row_content": "<p>Integrity is our priority. Our sensitive toothpaste is PETA cruelty-free certified and 100% vegan.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7dTA9p": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you have more questions about Boka?",
            "row_content": "<p>Please <a href=\"mailto:hello@boka.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:hello@boka.com\">contact us </a>and we’ll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_dXKLmM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Processing and Shipping Times",
            "row_content": "<p>For orders placed with standard shipping, please allow 1-2 business days for processing and up to 5 business days for delivery. Exact timing can vary depending on size of the order and delivery destination. Orders placed after 1 p.m. EST on Fridays, over the weekend, or on major U.S. holidays will likely not be processed until the following business day. </p><p>Expedited orders placed after 10 a.m. EST may be shipped the following business day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
